      "en": "So these three men ceased to answer Job, because he was righteous in his own eyes.",
      "ko": "욥이 스스로 의롭게 여기므로 그 세 사람의 대답이 그치매",
      "source_text_hash": "f15bacb363a63867c551788f68c802bc2c3fc9d86d426814663ad341b59adad3",
      "translation_text_hash": "31d677610246b0ee25772331ce4db7f22a8c6e94342b5ed21d08d2355a5c8095",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
