      "en": "Now Elihu had waited to speak to Job, because they were older than he.",
      "ko": "엘리후가 그들의 나이 자기보다 많으므로 욥에게 말하기를 참고 있다가",
      "source_text_hash": "3853531962da5e4539baf6453221e309519b8edb34b2c9655856afa9bb5f48be",
      "translation_text_hash": "d45af19c33efb9dc7692bcd8b5c055a947f231ea8492557205dc6614f937474e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "엘리후가 그들의 나이 자기보다 많으므로 욥에게 말하기를 참고 있다가"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d45af19c33efb9dc7692bcd8b5c055a947f231ea8492557205dc6614f937474e"
      ]
    },
    {
