      "en": "Yes, I gave you my full attention, but there was no one who convinced Job, or who answered his words, among you.",
      "ko": "자세히 들은즉 당신들 가운데 욥을 꺾어 그 말을 대답하는 자가 없도다",
      "source_text_hash": "07be471880fa58513fc187b966d1e8527966bf1bea44d2918e31c05d12288ec3",
      "translation_text_hash": "d37351a4905acc302cb5658cb2cd18185cfc6124856e3d1974fcbd913a5aeb9b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "자세히 들은즉 당신들 가운데 욥을 꺾어 그 말을 대답하는 자가 없도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d37351a4905acc302cb5658cb2cd18185cfc6124856e3d1974fcbd913a5aeb9b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOB:32:13",
      "sequence": 13642,
      "chapter_label": "JOB 32",
