      "en": "“They are amazed. They answer no more. They don’t have a word to say.",
      "ko": "그들이 놀라서 다시 대답하지 못하니 할 말이 없음이로구나",
      "source_text_hash": "85608abfa60d2a663d7b8210bf20e2a342be5355747c61ea94e65a8c67933944",
